# Somo brand assets

Before adding or changing logos, favicons, or nav marks:

1. Read [docs/Brand/LOGO_AND_ICON_SSOT.md](docs/Brand/LOGO_AND_ICON_SSOT.md) (in [docs/Brand/README.md](docs/Brand/README.md)).
2. Use files from `unified-dashboard/assets/brand/` only.
3. Run `npm run brand:sync` after updating SSOT — do not hand-copy one-off logos into `middleware-platform/public/`.

**Logo (light UI):** `somo-logo.png` (Somo title-case lockup).

**Icon / favicon:** `somo-icon.png` and generated `favicon.*` — never legacy gecko/lizard/dot-cluster assets, never CSS text logos.

**Dark ink bars:** `somo-icon.png` + League Spartan “Somo” text, or full lockup per SSOT doc. Accent color: `#1C35EA`.

Do not create DocLittle spans, dodgecall marks, or AI-generated wordmarks.
